{
  "items": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "The music library is great, but the app crashes on my Android phone every few days. It's annoying but I keep using it because I like the playlists."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "I love the new Discover Weekly feature. It's surprisingly accurate for my taste. The only thing holding me back from a 10 is the price increase last year."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Best streaming service out there. The audio quality on my headphones is crisp, and the family plan is a steal for our household. No complaints at all."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "Good for podcasts, but the music recommendations have gotten repetitive lately. I keep hearing the same five songs on shuffle. Needs some variety."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "I appreciate the offline downloads for my commute. The interface is clean and easy to navigate. Just wish the lyrics feature worked better on older songs."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "Solid service. The student discount is a lifesaver for me. I don't use it for podcasts, but the music catalog is extensive and the app is stable."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "Too many ads even on premium? No, wait, I'm on free. The ads are intrusive and the shuffle is forced. I'm considering switching to Apple Music."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "The car integration via Bluetooth is seamless. I can control everything from the steering wheel. The only downside is the occasional buffering in my basement."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "I like the new UI changes, though it took a while to get used to. The playlist curation is top-notch. I'd give it a 10 if they fixed the search bar lag."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "Absolutely love it. The daily mixes are perfect for my workouts. Customer support was helpful when I had a billing issue. Highly recommend to anyone."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "Terrible. My account got locked for no reason and support took three weeks to respond. I lost all my saved playlists. Never again."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "It's okay. The music is there, but the app feels bloated. I don't use the social features, so why are they taking up so much space? It's just average."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "Worst experience ever. The app froze during a live event and I couldn't restart it. I paid for premium and got nothing. Refund my money."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "The podcast integration is seamless. I switch between music and shows without any hassle. The audio quality is consistent across all devices. Great job."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "Really good. The recommendations are spot on. I only docked one point because the offline download limit is too low for my long flights."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "Unacceptable. I was charged twice for the same month and support ignored my emails. I'm cancelling immediately. This is a scam."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "Love the new high-fidelity audio option. It makes a huge difference with my studio monitors. The app is fast and the catalog is unmatched."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "Perfect. The family plan works well for us. Everyone has their own profile, and the parental controls are easy to set up. No issues at all."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "Great service overall. The lyrics feature is a nice touch. I just wish the search function was a bit faster. Otherwise, I'm very happy with it."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "I like the music, but the app is a bit heavy on my older phone. It slows down when I switch between tabs. Still, the content is worth it."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "text": "The ads are too long and frequent. I feel like I'm being punished for not paying. The shuffle mode is also too random. I'm looking for alternatives."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "text": "Complete disaster. The app crashed during a concert and I couldn't get it back. I lost my entire library. This is unacceptable for a paid service."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "text": "Good for the price. The music catalog is huge, and the app is stable. I don't use the podcasts, but the music is what I care about. Solid choice."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "text": "I hate it. The recommendations are terrible. I listen to jazz and it keeps pushing pop music on me. I'm switching to a service that actually understands my taste."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "text": "The app is buggy on my tablet. It keeps crashing when I try to download songs. I've tried reinstalling it, but the problem persists. Very frustrating."
    }
  ]
}
